    "summary": "EquiTrust Life Insurance Company announced a strategic partnership with life and annuity platform Sureify this week. The collaboration is designed to advance EquiTrust’s digital transformation, modernizing the firm’s technology infrastructure by connecting systems, enhancing the flow of data, and reducing operational complexity throughout the business. At the center of the partnership, EquiTrust will deploy Sureify’s Read more...\nThe post EquiTrust Life Partners with Sureify to Streamline Data Exchange appeared first on Finovate.",
